flowchart TD
    Start([Open tracker page]) --> Load[Load first registered tracker]
    Load --> Permission{Location permission granted?}
    Permission -- No --> Error[Show permission error]
    Error --> Stop([Stop])
    Permission -- Yes --> StartTracking[Start geolocation watcher]
    StartTracking --> Reading[Read GPS position]
    Reading --> Valid{Position valid?}
    Valid -- No --> ReadError[Show location error]
    ReadError --> StopWatching[Stop watcher]
    Valid -- Yes --> Post[POST location to API]
    Post --> Stored{API accepts point?}
    Stored -- No --> ApiError[Show API error]
    ApiError --> Reading
    Stored -- Yes --> Update[Update coordinates and update count]
    Update --> Continue{Still tracking?}
    Continue -- Yes --> Reading
    Continue -- No --> StopWatching
    StopWatching --> End([Tracking stopped])
